BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Congregation Beth Ami
DTSTART:20151024T003000Z
DTEND:20151024T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:4uuprnktshctnne0448b2741v0@google.com
CREATED:20150918T213317Z
DESCRIPTION:Beth Ami and You presents Rockin' Shabbat for Kids from 5:30 - 
 6 PM - Songs and Shabbat service for kids of all ages!\n\nDelicious Dinner 
 from 6 - 7 PM (Buy tickets and RSVP by Tuesday 10/20 by calling Elizabeth a
 t 360-3000)\n\nRockin' Shabbat for Adults and Families 7 PM - The main prog
 ram of lively music and spirited davening with SF-based World-music perform
 er Lior Ben-Hur\n\nfrom www.liorbenhur.com: With their positive message\, u
 plifting melodies and unique and refreshing approach to Reggae\, this San F
 rancisco based band represents a new generation of Reggae and World music.\
 n \nBorn in Jerusalem\, Israel with Greek and Iraqi roots\, Lior Ben-Hur ha
 s traveled to over a dozen countries where he spent time learning\, perform
 ing and sharing experiences with musicians and artists around the globe. \n
 For the last ten years\, Lior made his home base in San Francisco\, CA. In 
 2011 he formed this band\, which in 2012 released an eclectic World music a
 lbum under the name Sol Tevél. The album sheds new light with contemporary 
 interpretations on old Jewish texts\, ideals and mysticism. \n \nAlong with
  his 7-piece band\, Lior Ben-Hur continues to focus on his passion for Regg
 ae music\, which has been a key inspiration on his musical creativity and s
 pirituality. Collaborating with leading artists such as Jah Levi and Marcus
  Urani of Groundation\, the band completed their self-tiled EP and is curre
 ntly recording a full-length album that will reveal their deep passion for 
 Reggae and demonstrate their ability to perform high-energy roots music.
LAST-MODIFIED:20150918T213317Z
LOCATION:Congregation Beth Ami & Santa Rosa JWSH Community Ctr\, 4676 Mayet
 te Ave\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95405\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Rockin' Shabbat with Lior Ben-Hur
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
