DESCRIPTION:The Rosh Chodesh Tevet gathering of Jewish women (all are welco
 me!)  will occur on Monday\, December 22 at 7pm in the Beth Ami Social Hall
 . It's the 6th day of Chanukah which means that we'll be lighting candles f
 or the 7th day ... bring your menorah and 8 candles (one for the shamash). 
 Our topic for the evening is books ... Jewish titles or themes. We look for
 ward to everyone sharing. As always\, we welcome snacks and beverages to sh
 are as well. Questions? Contact Bonnie Boren (bonniegboren@gmail.com) or Pa
 tty Bernstein (basberyl@sonic.net). Looking forward to seeing everyone next
  Monday night!
