UID:1sth0p4j2vqfrjffi081qguod0@google.com
CREATED:20160601T193037Z
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate with Pride at the Sonoma County Pride Parade June 5\n
 \nWe have formed a Keshet (meaning Rainbow) Committee co-chaired by Arnold 
 and me. We are planning various events and the first one is to participate 
 in the Sonoma County Pride Parade in Guerneville on Sunday\, June 5th. We w
 elcome everyone to join us on this day of Pride and Celebration for the LGB
 T Community. The parade is an easy walk and commences at a relaxing pace. W
 e encourage carpools since parking is a challenge in Guerneville on a busy 
 day. I hope that many members will join the Keshet Committee for the parade
  to physically demonstrate that Beth Ami is egalitarian and celebrates dive
 rsity.\n\n There will be carpools leaving Beth Ami at 8:30 and 9:30 (after 
 the morning minyan). Please let Rabbi Miller or Henry Cohn (henry.cohn@rock
 etmail.com or at 415.497.2723) know if you need to car-pool.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160601T193037Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pride Parade
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
