CREATED:20150604T195054Z
DESCRIPTION:Women's Rosh Chodesh Tammuz by the River\n\nTammuz is tomorrow\
 , Thursday June 18\, and since the days are long\, the women's Rosh Chodesh
  group will head for the outdoors.  6 pm Brown bag dinner with shared treat
 s\, then walk around the lake or as much as you want...  Riverfront Regiona
 l Park\, 7821 Eastside Road\, Windsor (see webpage) There's a nice shady re
 dwood grove near the parking lot with tables\, where we'll meet\, and a lev
 el trail around the ponds where we'll walk. The distance is lass than walki
 ng around Spring Lake and the trail is flat. It's a very nice park that not
  everybody knows about.
LAST-MODIFIED:20150617T172215Z
LOCATION:Riverfront Regional Park\, 7821 Eastside Road\, Windsor 
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Rosh Chodesh Women's Group
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
