UID:2celb4b60rp5q6qi3p1h71200g@google.com
CREATED:20160810T184428Z
DESCRIPTION:TISHA B'AV evening of Saturday\, \nAugust 13\, \n8:00-10:00 pm\
 nJoin us for Tisha B'Av program and services. We will start with a program 
 of study or discussion at 8:00 pm\, followed at 9:00 pm by Havdalah and a s
 ervice. This holy day commemorates the destruction of the Second Temple. Du
 ring the evening service we will sit on the floor and take turns reading by
  candle light from the book of Lamentations - a somber set of elegies about
  the destruction of the First Temple and the siege of Jerusalem. \n \nThe S
 unday morning service at 8:30 will also be somewhat different in that we do
 n't put on tallis and t'philin.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160810T184428Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tisha B'Av program and services
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
