  – 7:00pm: Vegetarian dinner & socializing\;\n7:00pm – 8:00pm: Kabbalat Sha
 bbat (Prayer Service) including music by Jubilee\, conversation & prayer\; 
 Oneg (desserts) to follow. \n\nPlease RSVP for the dinner by phoning or ema
 iling the office.\n\nClick here for more information:\nhttp://bethamisr.org
 /wp-content/uploads/2014/03/Rockin-Shabbat-with-Jubilee.pdf
