DESCRIPTION:Ever wonder what to do with a wall of donated matzah?   \n     
       Well\, come enjoy a Matzah Brei Fry on Sunday\, July 19th and help us
  break down that wall.   \n           We'll have all your favorite condimen
 ts.   \n\nTo cover the cost of additional supplies for the breakfast and to
  benefit the Religious school\, the cost is $8 for adults and $4 per child.
   If you've donated blood at this year's Interfaith blood drive on Bethards
  on Sunday July19\, 2015 come enjoy breakfast for free. 
