DESCRIPTION:Rockin' Shabbat February 19\n \nOn February 19th we are hosting
  the angelic-voiced Mia Miriam Cohen\, local musician and Jewish educator. 
 She uses her gorgeous voice\, percussion\, instrumentation and chanting for
  an elevated musical davening experience. It will be participatory and fun!
  Please save the date for our dinner and Rockin' Shabbat!\n\n5:30 - 6:00 p.
 m. Kids' Shabbat with Mia\n6:00 p.m. Community dinner $8 for members\, $10 
 for nonmembers\, $4 for children\, 4 & under free. RSVP to Beth Ami's offic
 e by Wednesday Feb. 17\n7:00 p.m. Musical Shabbat Services led by Rabbi Mor
 decai Miller and Mia Miriam Cohen
