 hich he lists works of Jewish interest: jewishbookworld.org\n\nClasses will
  be held at Beth Ami on Thursdays from 7 to 8:30 and will start on April 16
 .  NOTE this differs from the original date printed in the Shofar because o
 f the Passover holiday.\n 
