DESCRIPTION:On September 1 we will observe Selichot\, the evening of the Sa
 turday before the beginning of the High Holy Days. We begin the evening wit
 h Havdalah and placing on the Torahs and bimah the white covers that are us
 ed only for the High Holy Days. Rabbi Miller will then lead a study on Maim
 onides’ Laws of Repentance in which there is an interesting description of 
 the future life. \n\n\n\nThe schedule for the evening is as follows:\n\n8:3
 0 – Havdalah and change Torah covers\n\n9:00 - Refreshments\n\n9:30 – Progr
 am\n\n10:00 – Selichot Service
LAST-MODIFIED:20180823T202531Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Selichot Program & Services
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
