UID:6h4bpvehcp83feu4k8p1mpr8pd@google.com
CREATED:20200714T185542Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><strong><br>Social Action and Adult Education Event<br></st
 rong><br><br><strong>Three evenings of education on&nbsp\;</strong><br><str
 ong>Civil Rights and Social Justice.</strong><br><strong><br></strong><br><
 strong><br></strong><br><strong>Thursday evenings at 7:00 p.m.\,&nbsp\;</st
 rong><br><strong>July 16\, 23\, 30</strong><br><br><em>Are you concerned ab
 out racism in our country? Are you pondering what you can do to help improv
 e civil rights? How can we help?&nbsp\;</em><br><strong>Benjamin Mertz</str
 ong>&nbsp\;will lead us as we explore these questions through lecture\, dis
 cussion and music.<br><br><p><strong>July 16 - From John Henry to George Fl
 oyd</strong>:&nbsp\;</p><p><em>A Brief history of Black oppression</em></p>
 <p><strong>July 23 - Give Me a Clean Heart:</strong></p><br><em>White privi
 lege and White supremacist structures</em><p><strong>July 30 - Climbing Up 
 the Mountain</strong>:</p><p><em>&nbsp\;How to be an ally in the 21st centu
 ry</em></p><p>&nbsp\;</p><p>Each session will be&nbsp\;<strong>50 minutes o
 f information\, storytelling\, singing\, and lecture and close with a 10-20
  minute Q &amp\; A.</strong></p><p><br>&nbsp\;</p><br>Benjamin Mertz\, a fo
 rmer Beth Ami Community Nursery School parent\, lives in the Bay Area and i
 s a is a Black social activist\, composer\, performer\, and song leader who
  specializes in music of the Black Spiritual tradition. Join us as we learn
  about black history\, music\, political causes for the social inequities t
 hat are causing all the pain\, suffering and social unrest today. Learn mor
 e about Benjamin Mertz at&nbsp\;<a href="http://r20.rs6.net/tn.jsp?f=001MrQ
 BZbyrXh5xeVgTUzoerwzbB0i5g0h5WUcmWK4ql1x0QWFnTp01v9t7Ic8FMmtt-nHJUZDAKNFlYQ
 mojBvyffiGGFb7NiermMVBmlAQWQBqiLCZYyze4uV64vVfX90nM2d-LEdlWFasyH8GU6QKR9Ogj
 G_4QtEJV3G2T6m7kA_B97fPZ1k3tQ==&amp\;c=NtgEA3V1DUbvUysClJUvW-RokzsecopUKnhv
 3lbEo1uulIqpTG_gYw==&amp\;ch=zDs1xcqsARZEQyqLSzk_308PWYM40lM5OWz7fkakdeTpDz
 r-xzkEcQ==">benjaminmertz.com</a>&nbsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20200714T185616Z
LOCATION:https://us02web.zoom.us/j/86004622070#success
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Benjamin Mertz on Civil Rights and Social Justic
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
