UID:136juahfc47rn95odvim8lu1ll@google.com
CREATED:20191111T202627Z
DESCRIPTION:Back at Beth Ami by popular demand!\nA Matter of Balance:\nMana
 ging Concerns About Falls\nSponsored by the Sonoma County Area Agency on Ag
 ing\nCo-sponsored by Friendship Circle of the Jewish\nCommunity Center of S
 onoma County and\nCongregation Beth Ami\nNovember 11 through December 4\,\n
 Mondays & Wednesdays\, 1 to 3 p.m.\n\nFalls are preventable! This fun\, FRE
 E eight-session program is for seniors at all mobility levels. Gain physica
 l and mental confidence\, awareness and learn about the many causes of fall
 s and practical\nways to eliminate hazards and reduce risks. Engage in simp
 le and safe chair exercise to improve strength\, endurance and flexibility.
 \nWhether you've fallen\, experienced a fall injury or you simply want to p
 roactively ensure better balance this class will benefit you with practical
  "next steps".\n\nSpace is limited. Enroll by phone to participate.\nNo new
  participants accepted after Session 2.\nReserve a spot today. Call Dana Ja
 coby at the Sonoma County Area Agency on Aging\,  707-565-5936.
LAST-MODIFIED:20191111T202656Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:A Matter of Balance: Managing Concerns About Falls
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
