DESCRIPTION:Kristallnacht - Night of Broken Glass\n80th Anniversary Commemo
 ration\nFriday Nov. 9th\, at 7:30 p.m. at Congregation Beth Ami\nEighty yea
 rs ago to the day (November 9th\, 1938)\, the Jews of Germany endured a ter
 rifying night of destruction\, arrests\, harassment\, arson\, and mayhem. H
 undreds of synagogues were damaged or destroyed. It was a profound event th
 at marked the true beginning of the Holocaust. \nPlease join us for a comme
 moration of that horrific night\, and the days that followed. \nReflections
  from Alfred and Susanne Batzdorff\, and Rhonda Findling \nMusic from Gale 
 Kissin and friends\, \nfollowing an abbreviated Erev Shabbat service. \nOne
 g Shabbat at the conclusion of the evening.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200325T180104Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Kristallnacht Rembembrance & Erev Shabbat Services
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
