DESCRIPTION:Please join Beth Ami in a celebration of our newlyweds\, Sharon
  and Douglas Kruschen.  We are honored to host the fourth Sheva Bracha at B
 eth Ami on November 13 at 6:30 p.m.  Douglas and Sharon will stand under th
 e chuppah on November 9\, in Hollywood\, FL. Sharon Benson has been our USY
  youth advisor group for the past two years.  We are delighted to share in 
 this lifecycle event with Sharon and Douglas. \n     There is no charge for
  this celebration\, but reservations are necessary. Please RSVP no later th
 an Monday\, November 10 to Elizabeth at 360.3000 or office@bethamisr.org.\n
