UID:CSVConvert5e03bac271aecaf8182f22de010b9130
CREATED:19000101T120000Z
DESCRIPTION:Once again we invite you to participate in a book discussion se
 ries that has attracted many folks who love books that stretch your mind an
 d challenge your imagination and to discuss them with like-minded people. \
 n \nWe meet at Congregation Beth Ami in Room 12-13 on the first Wednesday o
 f each month at 10 a.m. beginning in November.\n\nHere is our schedule: \n\
 nJoy Comes in the Morning\, Jonathan Rosen  Nov. 1\nThe Liberated Bride\, b
 y A.B. Yehoshua\, \nDec. 6                               \nThe Namesake\,\n
 Jhumpa Lahiri   Jan. 3\nA Simple Story\, by  S. Agnon  Feb. 8\nThe March\, 
 Doctorow\, Mar. 7
LAST-MODIFIED:20210101T000000Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beth Ami Book Discussion Series
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
