 ng her tallit workshop again this fall. Price:$162.00 -includes all materia
 ls for one silk tallit\, 3 classes & instruction from Marcia in coordinatio
 n with Rabbi Schlesinger - call Beth Ami office to register. Payment must b
 e received by 11/12/06. Class limited to 15 particpants. Artistic and sewin
 g skills not necessary.
