UID:CSVConverta137874bc7fe51342f637b7be08dfde4
CREATED:19000101T120000Z
DESCRIPTION:This year well meet at Lake Ralphine for Tashlich (with Shomre
 i Torah members).  This is a remarkable ceremony  symbolic and concrete al
 l at the same time. Through this ritual\, we express not only our desire to
  be free from sin but our continuing hope that we will be forgiven for past
  misdeeds. It is customary to go to a flowing body of water and to recite p
 rayers while casting our sins (represented by bread crumbs) into the wate
 r. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20210101T000000Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tashlich
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
