CREATED:19000101T120000Z
DESCRIPTION:If you have admired the many beautiful and unique hand-made tal
 litot worn at Beth Ami and if you've ever thought of making one yourself\, 
 this is your chance. Talented artist and teacher Marcia Gladstone is offeri
 ng her tallit workshop again this fall. Price:$162.00 -includes all materia
 ls for one silk tallit\, 3 classes & instruction from Marcia in coordinatio
 n with Rabbi Schlesinger - call Beth Ami office to register. Payment must b
 e received by 11/12/06. Class limited to 15 particpants. Artistic and sewin
 g skills not necessary.
LAST-MODIFIED:20210101T000000Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tallit Making Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
