UID:6au57j75sbhgoq02qf09o78p4h@google.com
CREATED:20220525T184757Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>Hi fellow congregants and friends of Beth Ami\,&nbsp\;<br>W
 e are all signed up for the&nbsp\;<b>Sonoma County 2022 Pride Parade on Sat
 urday\, June 4th\, in Santa Rosa.&nbsp\;</b>The theme is We are Family. Com
 e show your pride and love for everyone in the community by walking with us
 .&nbsp\;<br><br>If you have a Pride t-shirt from Beth Ami\,&nbsp\;rainbow c
 olored clothes or pink colored clothes&nbsp\;come dressed and ready to walk
  the 5 block Parade down 4th Street from Brookwood.&nbsp\;We'll gather at 9
 :30 a.m for a quick Shabbat morning service and then line up for the walk c
 lose to Brookwood and 4th. More details to follow.&nbsp\;We will have poste
 rs that shows what brings us together like family. Bring sunscreen\, walkin
 g shoes and water.<br><br>Want to help or participate?&nbsp\;Contact the of
 fice at&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:office@bethamisr.org"><b><u>office@bethamisr.
 org&nbsp\;with your name and email&nbsp\;address</u></b></a>.&nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ;
LAST-MODIFIED:20220525T184757Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sonoma County Pride Parade
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
