RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20220722T180000
CREATED:20210630T175418Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><b>Don’t Miss Our Special Friday Shabbat Service for Ukrain
 e</b><br><b>This Friday\, July 22\, 6:00 pm</b><br><b>We will be welcoming 
 two Ukrainian families to our service.</b><br><br><br><b>During our Oneg\, 
 another guest will share their experience living in Ukraine.</b><br><br><b>
 Please join Rabbi Miller for a special D’Var Torah</b><br><b>(</b><b><i>Als
 o\, on Zoom - see website for link</i></b><b>).</b><br><b>Ukrainian music b
 y the Klezmer Creek Band.</b><br><b>Following the service\, please join us 
 for a special Oneg</b><br><b>in the courtyard with Ukrainian pastries.&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><br><b>Masks will be required for the indoor por
 tion of this event.&nbsp\;</b><br><b>&nbsp\;</b><br><b>As a social justice 
 issue\, our committee wants to express our support for the citizens of Ukra
 ine. The devastation is heartbreaking and difficult to process.</b><br><b>O
 ur service will speak to our concerns and hopefully give us a direction in 
 our efforts.</b><br><b>We pray for peace and justice for all.</b><br><b>The
  Committee on Racism and Social Justice</b><br><b>&nbsp\;</b><br><b>Here ar
 e some organizations that are helping Jews and others in Ukraine:</b><br>Am
 erican Jewish Joint Distribution Committee&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;Project Kesher&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>World 
 Jewish Relief&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;HIAS&n
 bsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<wbr>World Central Ki
 tchen
LAST-MODIFIED:20230209T203627Z
SEQUENCE:4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Shabbat Service for Ukraine
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
