X-SOURCE:Congregation Beth Ami
DTSTART:20130224T210000Z
DTEND:20130225T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:7tdoe9olum0b6sludanpi0uj38@google.com
CREATED:20121226T182259Z
DESCRIPTION:Co-sponsored with Sonoma area congregations\, a Purim Party for
  2 to 8 year olds and their families will take place on Sunday\, February 2
 4th at 1 p.m. in Congregation Beth Ami's Social Hall and courtyard.  Carniv
 al games with prizes\, arts and crafts\, and a food ticket are included for
  the $5 entry fee for each child. Facepainting\, additional food and drink 
 tickets\, and a cupcake walk can be purchased as well.  Costumes for all ag
 es are encouraged.  For more information call the CBA office at 707 - 360 -
  3000. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T061401Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Purim Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
