DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:31e9ev4b2nostu5vhq7cf7ndkf@google.com
CREATED:20220715T194215Z
DESCRIPTION:The September 18 Presentation “Stewards of Eden” will focus on 
 the lifeways and world view of Native Americans of the North Bay Region\, h
 ighlighting the similarities with ancient Jewish culture.  Special emphasis
  will be given to the Native American spiritual systems and extraordinary e
 cological impact of their environmental practices that changed California h
 abitats.  There is much to be learned from Native perspectives and history 
 in California.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220718T181133Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Illustrated Presentation "Stewards of Eden" with Ben Benson
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
