 grapher Ronnie Rosenbach&nbsp\;</strong><br><br>Tu B'Shevat is a full moon 
 festival that celebrates the gifts of nature&nbsp\;<br>and the renewed cycl
 e of the seasons. Join us on Erev Tu B'Shevat\, Wednesday January 27 at 7:0
 0 p.m. in our Beth Ami Zoom Room for an appreciation of the holiday with mu
 sic and poetry\, and featuring photographer Ronnie Rosenbach. Ronnie will t
 ake us through selections from her stunning portfolio\, as we get an unders
 tanding of seeing&nbsp\;<br>nature through art.&nbsp\;
