CREATED:20230127T205133Z
DESCRIPTION:Since Tu B’Shevat puts wine in a featured role in the Tu B'Shev
 at Seder\, we will visit the Ron Rubin Winery near Sebastopol\, Monday Febr
 uary 6 from 2-4 PM we will enjoy a winery tour followed by a tasting with c
 rackers and cheeses (supplied by Beth Ami).<br><br><b>Please RSVP to the Be
 th Ami office</b>. We need to tell the winery how many people to expect. Th
 e winery is providing the tasting free of charge\, and Beth Ami is providin
 g cheese and crackers\, etc. There is no charge for the Tu B’Shevat event\,
  but a donation to Beth Ami will be helpful\, and if you enjoy the wines fr
 om Ron Rubin\, you might want to purchase some.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230127T205359Z
LOCATION:Ron Rubin Winery 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tu B'Shevat Winery Tour and Tasting 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
