 t of Jewish online learning resources and then will focus on the forms\, me
 thods and places one can learn about Judaism online  The presentation will 
 be followed with a discussion\, including a communal sharing of further res
 ources. You are guaranteed to take home a list of useful and inspiring idea
 s and web addresses (URLs).
