DESCRIPTION:The centerpiece will be a candle-lighting ceremony by Holocaust
  survivors escorted by local teens and college students. \n\nFeatured speak
 ers: three generations of the Turner/Bornstein family\, telling the story o
 f the journey from Europe through Shanghai to Santa Rosa\, and the transmis
 sion of Holocaust memory within their family and Gesher Calmenson\, founder
  of Remember Us: The Holocaust Bnai Mitzvah Project will share ways that Ho
 locaust memory is being transmitted to a new generation in synagogues aroun
 d the country. \n\nMusical selections by gifted teen musicians from the Jew
 ish Community High School of the Bay in San Francisco accompanied by Maestr
 o Gary Sheldon\, and liturgical music by cantorial soloist Fredi Bloom. \n\
 n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T062738Z
LOCATION:The Friedman Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yom Hashoah Commemoration
TRANSP:OPAQUE
