CREATED:20110912T230025Z
DESCRIPTION:Everything you wanted to know about the HHD but were afraid to 
 ask \nThe Introduction to the High Holy Days Workshop is a gentle and brief
  introduction to the Rosh Hashanah and Yom Kippur designed for those who wa
 nt an understanding of the meaning of the two holidays.  The programming wa
 s created by the National Jewish Outreach Program (http://njop.org) and is 
 designed to give participants a taste of what the holidays are and some of 
 their most notable prayers.  The program was designed for those who may hav
 e attended services without understand their meaning.  Those who rarely or 
 never attend services will get the most from the workshop.  The program is 
 free and open to all.   \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063244Z
LOCATION:Beth Ami Sanctuary
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Introduction to the High Holy Days
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
