CREATED:20120213T184400Z
DESCRIPTION:As Israel turns 64\, Sonoma County is once again holding a Birt
 hday Party for it.  The party begins at 7:00 pm April 26 in the Social Hall
  of Congregation Beth Ami.  It is free to all\, thanks to generous donation
 s.  The celebrations include food\, music\, sharing of experiences by volun
 teers for Israel\, a fun and enlightening talk by beloved scholar Rabbi Jer
 ry Danzig\, a showing of the new film “Israel Inside”\, and MORE.  Bring th
 e whole family to enjoy the celebration of 64 years of the modern day mirac
 le we call “Israel”.  
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T062503Z
LOCATION:Social Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yom Ha'atzmaut Birthday Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
