BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Congregation Beth Ami
DTSTART:20111104T020000Z
DTEND:20111104T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:v6i10hckp4udn3ac91806ejtso@google.com
CREATED:20111024T182150Z
DESCRIPTION:Who Cares About Education? You are invited to join us for: A Co
 nversation on Education and the Economy\, Thursday\, Nov. 3rd\, 7:00-8:30 p
 m\, at Congregation Beth Ami\, 4676 Mayette Ave\, Santa Rosa.\nWhat’s has c
 hanged at your neighborhood school? What has been your experience with loca
 l schools? What is working and what’s not working? What are your concerns a
 nd hopes for your children and grandchildren’s education?\nRepresentatives 
 of the North Bay Sponsoring Committee’s\, Education Research/Action team ha
 ve been talking with leaders in Education in our local schools. Administrat
 ors\, Principals\, Teachers\, Counselors and parents have been interviewed 
 and this gathering is to provide an update on what we have learned about sc
 hools and education in Sonoma County. These leaders have been invited to at
 tend this meeting as well.\nThis will also be an opportunity to hear and sh
 are stories about your own personal experiences. Conversations will address
  what we can do about the problems facing schools in Sonoma County today.\n
 Sponsored by the Education Research Team of the North Bay Sponsoring Commit
 tee. Beth Ami is one of nine congregations that are members of the NBSC.\nF
 or further information and to RSVP\, please email Ellen Mundell\, emundell@
 sonic.net
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T062645Z
LOCATION:Congregation Beth Ami
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Education Forum
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
