UID:qra2ta41o2fo7nlll95r719d8k@google.com
CREATED:20091123T153824Z
DESCRIPTION:The tenth of the twelve months of the Jewish calendar is Tevet\
 , which begins with the last days of Chanukah. We will light the menorah\, 
 share Chanukah treats and reminisce of a matriarch (our mother\, grandmothe
 r or even our own daughters) who has inspired or challenged us.  If you lik
 e\, bring an artifact (photo\, souvenir\, clothing\, letter\, or any object
 ) that helps tell a story about the woman who shaped your life. For more in
 formation call Ellen Mundell\, 538-5528.  \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T062802Z
SEQUENCE:4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Rosh Chodesh Tevet
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
