CREATED:20100714T203816Z
DESCRIPTION:Simcha Sunday\, the JCC's festival that celebrates all things J
 ewish\, will be held this year on Sunday\, February 27\, 2011. Once again a
 t the Veterans Building in Santa Rosa\, you can meet old friends and new\, 
 see what amazing Jewish resources Sonoma County has to offer\, be entertain
 ed and of course\, eat\, eat\, eat! New this year - join in a Yiddish music
  workshop\, dance at the closing Klezmer Dance Party and get a taste of all
 -round Yiddish culture as we join with KlezCalifornia to bring you a celebr
 ation of Yiddishkeit.\n\nSimcha Sunday will be held at the Santa Rosa Veter
 ans Memorial Building  and the entrance fee is $5 per person.\n\nFor more i
 nformation on Simcha Sunday\, contact Karen Gould at kareng@jccsoco.org or 
 707-528-4222.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T061956Z
LOCATION:Santa Rosa Veteran's Memorial Bldg.
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Simcha Sunday
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
