DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20100423
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100426
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:9f0m4l91680qn0j8v1e26snai4@google.com
CREATED:20100224T233034Z
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County’s United Synagogue Youth is excited to be hosting
  New Frontier’s Social Action and Tikkun Olam Shabbaton  April 23 - 25.  Th
 is event will bring in Jewish youth from San Jose to Reno and more to Beth 
 Ami for a weekend full of services\, learning\, social action\, tikkun olam
 \, and fun! We hope you join us for services\, which will be lead by USYers
 \, as well as a special Shabbat Dinner with USY.  Hope to see you there!\n\
 nFor more questions please contact USY advisor Sarah Stein at scusy@bethami
 sr.org\n\nWe are also asking the community for assistance in hosting the US
 Yers on Saturday night. If you have space available please contact Nancy Sh
 erman at (707) 538-9388 or enshermn@pacbell.net \n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T062910Z
LOCATION:Congregation Beth Ami
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:SATO Regional USY Weekend
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
