BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Congregation Beth Ami
DTSTART:20130421T190000Z
DTEND:20130421T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:9nq20p8fjpl3854i1cov6suv2k@google.com
CREATED:20130418T192138Z
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County's Jewish Cultural Fair\, Simcha Sunday\,brought t
 o you by the Jewish Community Center\,is designed to bring together and sho
 wcase the rich and varied aspects of Jewish life in Sonoma County.\n\nThere
  will be something for everyone: information & resource tables\, an action-
 packed kids' area\, live music\, ethnic food\, artists\, vendors and lots o
 f schmooze time at this community celebration! Look for hourly drawings for
  free door prizes donated by our vendors\; shop for Judaica art and gifts\,
  jewelry and more.\n\nOnce again at the Santa Rosa Memorial Veterans Buildi
 ng\, from noon to 4:00 pm\, you can meet old friends and new\, see what ama
 zing Jewish resources Sonoma County has to offer\, be entertained and of co
 urse\, eat\, eat\, eat! And thanks to a grant from the Koret Foundation\, a
 ttendance is FREE! New this year- a tented outside eating area with music\;
  a marketplace lined with vendors offering samples and unique products for 
 sale\; real\, honest-to-goodness\, barbequed hot dogs with gourmet condimen
 ts and lots of other delicious delicacies. Everyone is invited - you don't 
 have to be Jewish to love this event!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T062004Z
LOCATION:Santa Rosa Veteran's Memorial Building
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Simcha Sunday
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
