BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Congregation Beth Ami
DTSTART:20101121T210000Z
DTEND:20101122T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:paqnflfgbsp3esp2pu4b0h299c@google.com
CREATED:20101025T221205Z
DESCRIPTION:Everyone is welcome to join beloved meditation teacher and mast
 er storyteller\nK’vod Weider for a lively spiritual journey in nature. Thro
 ugh stories and guided\nactivities\, K’vod will invite children and their f
 amilies to be spiritual adventurers ~\njourneying through a magical forest\
 , where the hidden treasures of a vibrant living\nTorah\, the Divine in nat
 ure\, and our own inner treasures\, can be discovered.\nThe afternoon will 
 conclude with a Jewish spirituality magic show! \nThis event is joyfully su
 pported and co-sponsored by Jewish organizations community-wide\, including
  Congregation Shir Shalom-Sonoma\, B’nai Israel Jewish Center-Petaluma\, Ne
 r Shalom-Cotati\, Sebastopol Jewish Community\, Congregation Shomrei Torah 
 and Congregation Beth Ami-Santa Rosa\, Camp Newman\, & JCC Sonoma County\, 
 a beneficiary of Jewish Federation of San Francisco\, Marin and Sonoma Coun
 ties\n$45.00 per family ~ $36.00 for members of co-sponsoring organizations
 \nFor more information and to register\, please contact Congregation Ner Sh
 alom\nat shalom@sonic.net or 707.664.8622. Or email Ashira Sheila Katz at s
