DTEND:20110809T043000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:jabmjv7lus0kqbpvqc86nnjn5s@google.com
CREATED:20110808T183930Z
DESCRIPTION:Observe Tisha b'Av at Congregation Beth Ami on Monday\, August 
 8th\, in the sanctuary beginning at 8:30 PM with Ma'ariv. Then take off you
 r shoes\, sit on the floor and join in reading Eicha-the Lamentations of Je
 remiah the Prophet-by candlelight. Tisha b'Av\, the 9th of Av\, commemorate
 s the destruction of both the 1st and 2nd Temples. The Sages taught that th
 e Temple was destroyed due to causeless hatred. A discussion will reflect o
 n how the lessons of Tisha b'Av apply to our lives today. The 9th of Av is 
 also the date on which Jews were expelled from England in 1290 and from Spa
 in in 1492.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T061801Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tisha B'Av Services
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
