 grandchildren and the survivors themselves\, will highlight Sonoma County’s
  annual community-wide Yom Hashoah commemoration. \n\nThe event will also f
 eature music\, candle lighting by Sonoma County’s Holocaust survivors – eac
 h escorted by a teen\, and a reading of the winning essay of the Susy Raful
  Student Essay Contest.  Special yellow Holocaust memorial candles will be 
 available for attendees for lighting at home.   \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063101Z
