DTEND:20130429T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:ijq3n0fpu7qu5qoonb0d2jh55k@google.com
CREATED:20130425T202644Z
DESCRIPTION:AGENDA: HA SIYUM HATORAH \n \nSunday: April 28\, 2013\n \n10:00
  a.m. Hakafot Procession around Beth Ami - Huppah and Music\n \n11:00 a.m. 
 Welcome: Russ Gurevitch\n \n11:05 a.m. Rabbi Miller "Siyum: It's History an
 d Traditions"\n \n11:20 a.m. Rachel and Josh Simkovitz: "Shoah Rimonim of N
 uremberg"\n \n11:30 a.m. Jonathan Sutter: Introduction of Rabbi David Rue (
 Sofer)\n \n11:35 a.m. Rabbi Rue Lecture: "Determining a Torah's Origin"\n \
 n12:30 p.m. Mariah\, Nick and Daniel: Mitzvah Notes from Religious School\n
  \n12:40 p.m.-Lunch (potluck dairy: bring salads only  see guidelines)\n \n
 1:45 p.m. Russ Gurevitch and Bea Waterhouse Introduce Afternoon Program\n \
 n1:50 p.m. Fredie Rembaum: "Sacred Scroll - It's Meaning in Jewish Life"\n 
 \n2:15 p.m. Arnold Drake Commences Siyum\nTorah is Completed with Congregan
 t Participation\nPhoto Session / Video Projection\nHakafot in Synagogue (in
 side)\n4:00 p.m.-Dinner: Sit Down (catered\, $18 per person\, register by m
 ailing\, calling or emailing the office)  Music by Zim Zum\n 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063103Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Ha Siyum Ha Torah
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
