UID:i0empmuoabqpgbmlav2ick4bhs@google.com
CREATED:20111216T203740Z
DESCRIPTION:Course No. 501: Tuesdays with Rabbi Danzig:  Great Jewish Think
 ers of the 20th Century:  In this course\, we will focus on three areas of 
 their theology: God\, prayer and practice – how one notion in-fluences and 
 is complemented by another.  We will study these three themes through the v
 iews of Kook\, Soloveitchik\, Kaplan and Heschel\, pillars of 20th century 
 rabbinic thought.  Through their philosophical and theological writings we 
 will examine our personal beliefs and the rationale for why we behave and p
 ractice as we do.  Taught for several weeks\, and followed by Torah Study (
 text to be determined).  On the 2nd and 4th Tuesday of each month\, startin
 g January 10 in Room 12/13.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063218Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Adult Ed. Class #501
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Congregation Beth Ami
DTSTART:20101219T030000Z
DTEND:20101219T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:2l8cv1e2hggq08rla40j2r6rhs@google.com
CREATED:20101020T205227Z
DESCRIPTION:Plans are underway for our first reunion of Jewish teens of Son
 oma County\, with the hope of bringing together Jewish teen alumni from the
  last 20 years.  We welcome Bnai Mitzvah from any Sonoma County synagogue\,
  USY\, NFTY\, Kehillah\, Tzadikim\, Madrichim\, Camp Chai Counselors.  Any 
 Jewish teen involved in Jewish teen life in Sonoma County over the last 20 
 years is invited. (Age 18+ and a high school graduate). \n\nWe will be join
 ed by Rabbis Gittleman\, Schlesinger\, Jonathan Slater\, as well as other r
 abbis who were with us during those years.  Beth Goodman\, former Camp Chai
  Director and current JCC\, Sonoma County Executive Director\, will be on h
 and\, as will Rick Concoff!  The evening should provide a unique opportunit
 y to re-assemble after many years and reconnect with your Jewish friends of
  the past. \n\nThe event will be a joyful one beginning with Havdalah and f
 ollowed by sharing\, shmoozing\, reconnecting and a vegetarian Middle Easte
 rn dinner.  The cost for the evening is $18. \n\nContact Rick at 707-823-39
 16 or rickc@jccsoco.org for more information
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T062835Z
LOCATION:Congregation Beth Ami
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Teen Program Reunion
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
