CREATED:20131007T173018Z
DESCRIPTION:Guest Artist Lior Ben Hur will bring his Reggae and Israeli fus
 ion music to mellow out the start of Shabbat on Friday\, October 18th. Come
  enjoy tunes at 4:30 for the preschool set.  Partake in a pasta dinner at 5
 :30.  At 7 p.m. join in Kabbalat Shabbat services with Lior and Rabbi Mille
 r. Dinner reservations recommended but no one turned away as long as the fo
 od lasts.  Dinner is $8 for adults\, $4 for 4 to 8 year olds and under 4 ar
 e free.  Call Lizzie in the office at 360 - 3000 by Thursday\, October 17th
 \, 4 p.m. Dinner can be paid until Candle-lighting at 6:10 p.m.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T062843Z
