CREATED:20090323T182836Z
DESCRIPTION:Help celebrate Yom Ha'Atzmaut at the Friedman Center\, 4676 May
 ette Avenue\, Santa Rosa.\n \nOur community presents an evening strengtheni
 ng our ties with Israel and fellow Jews around the world. Enjoy Israeli foo
 d\, music\, stories\, dance\, crafts\, and singing.\nPrices: $15 for adults
  & $9 for children 6-12 (5 and under free). \n \nMake your check out to JCC
  (Israel Birthday Dinner) and mail it to Jewish Community Center\, 170 Farm
 ers Lane\, # 5\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95405 . To pay by credit card\, call JCC a
 t (707) 528-4222.\n \n\nThis celebration is the shared joy of Congregations
  Beth Ami and Shomrei Torah\, JCC\, JCRC North Bay\, Jewish Family and Chil
 dren's Services\, Jewish Community Free Clinic\, and Hillel of Sonoma Count
 y with cooperation from Chabad of Sonoma County. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063225Z
LOCATION:The Friedman Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yom Ha'Atzmaut - Israeli Independence Day Celebration
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
