CREATED:20130611T225309Z
DESCRIPTION:On the first Friday of each month the congregation gathers in t
 he Social Hall for a delicious gourmet Shabbat dinner complete with a kid’s
  “menu.” After dinner there are family-style services in the sanctuary with
  joyful singing and stories. The oneg is truly a treat with live music\, Is
 raeli folk-dancing\, coffee and cake. Mail in your reservation or call the 
 office at 360-3000. Member Adults\, $18\; Non-Member Adults\, $22. Children
  5-12 $9\; under 5 free.
