CREATED:20111011T204155Z
DESCRIPTION:Rembaum on Rembaum: Mishneh Torah\, Hikhot T'filah (Laws of Pra
 yer). We will read and discuss selections from from Maimondes' seminal law 
 code that relate to the traditions associated with the Amidah and other asp
 ects of worship. From time to time comparisons with other halakhic sources\
 , from antiquity to our day\, will be made. We will read the texts in Engli
 sh translation\, but the Hebrew original will be present for consultation. 
 \nTaught by Rabbi Rembaum on Thursdays at 6:30\, when he is present\, start
 ing Nov. 3
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063747Z
LOCATION:Congregation Beth Ami 
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Adult Ed. #201 - Rembaum on Rembaum
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
