UID:q771uut0inb7n9afrj8k3a8nok@google.com
CREATED:20121217T204910Z
DESCRIPTION:Do We Have A Prayer?  \nRabbi Mordecai Miller\nWhat's prayer al
 l about\, anyway?  What's it \nsupposed to accomplish? How can I relate to 
 \nwords written so long ago?  What is "Service of \nthe Heart"?  An in-dept
 h exploration into key \nwords used in the Siddur (Prayer book) as well \na
 s the various types of prayer.  We will look \ninto several familiar prayer
 s.  Object: To \nunderstand the Hebrew as well as the poetry \nand to disco
 ver ways in which to engage the \nprayer
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063326Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Adult Ed. course with Rabbi Miller
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
