DESCRIPTION:Just because the sun is shining doesn't mean that the moon's cy
 cles have been discontinued. Indeed\, these clear summer evenings allow us 
 to monitor the waxing and the waning\, experience the full moon\, and antic
 ipate the new moon when Jewish women gather to celebrate a new month. \n \n
 \nAll Jewish women are invited\, regardless of affiliation (or non-affiliat
 ion). If you're interested in being part of the planning or if you want to 
 notified about the details\, contact Patty Bernstein at basberyl@ sonic.net
  or 546-6043.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063919Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Rosh Chodesh Women's Group
TRANSP:OPAQUE
