CREATED:20250213T000646Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The Annual Sonoma County Yom HaShoah Commemoration will be h
 eld on Sunday\, April 27\, from 3-5 p.m. The event will be held live at Con
 gregation Shomrei Torah\, with streaming available for people who can’t att
 end in person.</p><p>The theme of this year’s commemoration will be “Rememb
 er One…Remember All.”<i></i></p><p>There will be musical performances as we
 ll as candle lighting by Jewish and other Holocaust survivors and those tar
 geted by genocide. <br> <br>The program is free\, but registration is requi
 red. Information about how to register for the event and submit names for t
 he memorial book is available at:  <a href="https://www.jccsoco.org/yom-has
 hoah" target="_blank">https://www.jccsoco.org/yom-<wbr />hashoah</a>.  You 
 can view last year’s commemoration using the same link.<br><br>Questions ca
 n be sent to <a href="mailto:yomhashoahsoco@gmail.com" target="_blank">yomh
 ashoahsoco@gmail.com</a></p><p>We hope that you will be joining us for this
  year’s commemoration!</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250213T000717Z
LOCATION:Congregation Shomrei Torah\, 2600 Bennett Valley Rd\, Santa Rosa\,
  CA 95404\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yom Hashoah Commemoration
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
