DTSTART:20090804T230000Z
DTEND:20090805T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:use5i0elbl6irs2qp9e2p0eu0k@google.com
CREATED:20090730T220432Z
DESCRIPTION:Bone Marrow matches needed.\n<br>\nBeth Ami has been alerted to
  the critical need for stem cell transplants for several Jews in the Bay Ar
 ea ... and no bone marrow matches known at this time. Because donors and re
 cipients need to be genetically compatible\, Jewish patients generally requ
 ire Jewish stem cell donors. \n<br>\nIf you are between the ages of 18-60 a
 nd in general good health\, we encourage you to be tested as a match. It's 
 simple ... just a swab of cells from the inside of the cheeks. You're then 
 entered into the registry\, where a shidduch can be made.\n<br>\nPlease\, c
 ome to Beth Ami on Tuesday\, August 4 from 4p.m. to 7 p.m. to take the swab
  test. You could save a life.
