BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Congregation Beth Ami
DTSTART:20130905T233000Z
DTEND:20130906T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:uh63e0bpsaid36bet0r5vdo2ak@google.com
CREATED:20130805T231336Z
DESCRIPTION:This will again be a joint service among members of Congregatio
 n Beth Ami and Congregation Shomrei Torah. We’ll meet at Lake Ralphine for 
 Tashlich.  This is a remarkable ceremony — symbolic and concrete all at the
  same time. Through this ritual\, we express not only our desire to be free
  from sin but our continuing hope that we will be forgiven for past misdeed
 s. It is customary to go to a flowing body of water and to recite prayers w
 hile “casting” our sins (represented by bread crumbs) into the water. \n\nW
 e encourage you to bring a picnic to enjoy together with other families at 
 the Howarth Park Gazebo picnic area.  After dinner\, please join us at 6:00
  for Mincha & Ma’ariv service in the park. \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063528Z
LOCATION:Howarth Park
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tashlich & Picnic at Howarth Park
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
