UID:4canbq12rvi383590ftm07el49@google.com
CREATED:20241011T194506Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><strong>Havdalah: Bidding a Fond Farewell to Shabbat</strong
 ><br>Our first community Havdalah will be on Saturday\, November 16th at 7p
 m. Time may vary since we make Havdalah when it gets dark. We’ll post the t
 ime in Cybershul and you can email the rabbi to find out: <a href="mailto:r
 abbi@bethamisr.org" target="_blank">rabbi@bethamisr.org</a><strong><br> </s
 trong><br>Let’s gather round to end Shabbat together\, with singing\, danci
 ng\, and smelling b’samim (fragrant spices). It’s an experiential moment\, 
 needing everyone’s active participation.<br> <br>Each gathering will segue 
 into the week with a fun activity\, accompanied by drinks and a nosh. You b
 ring the drinks\; we’ll bring the nosh. November 16th we’ll do Karaoke. On 
 December 14th we’ll have a game night. Future Havdalah night ideas: paintin
 g night\, storytelling\, poetry\, mic night\, movies.</p><p><br></p><p>Have
  other ideas? Send them to <a href="mailto:office@bethamisr.org" target="_b
 lank">office@bethamisr.org</a>. Please put “Havdalah<strong></strong> gathe
 rings” in the subject line.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20241030T173645Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Havdalah & Karaoke
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
