CREATED:20111011T204155Z
DESCRIPTION:Rembaum on Rambam: Mishneh Torah\, Hikhot T'filah (Laws of Pray
 er). We will read and discuss selections from from Maimondes' seminal law c
 ode that relate to the traditions associated with the Amidah and other aspe
 cts of worship. From time to time comparisons with other halakhic sources\,
  from antiquity to our day\, will be made. We will read the texts in Englis
 h translation\, but the Hebrew original will be present for consultation. \
 nTaught by Rabbi Rembaum on Thursdays at 6:30\, when he is present\, starti
 ng Nov. 3
LAST-MODIFIED:20240918T041546Z
LOCATION:Congregation Beth Ami 
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Adult Ed. #201 - Rembaum on Rambam
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
