DESCRIPTION:Matthew Gollub\, children's book author and former Nursery Scho
 ol parent\, will be performing and selling his books and CDs.  Matthew will
  be talking about Family Literacy\, reading from his works\, doing storytel
 ling and drumming and inviting audience participation.  This program is gea
 red for young children and their parents (and grandparents!)  After the sho
 w\, Matthew will be signing any books purchased that evening and will be do
 nating 20% of the proceeds to the Nursery School.  This promises to be a lo
 t of fun and a wonderful fundraiser for the school!  There will be a $10. p
 er family entry fee at the door.  Tell your friends and plan to come!
