DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Morning Minyan at 8:30 AM\, in the Chapel. Stay
  after for breakfast in the Social Hall. If you need a weekday minyan to sa
 y Kaddish\, please call the Beth Ami office at 360-3000 or Susanne Batzdorf
 f at 538-9731.  \nThis is the concluding day of Sukkot. We march around wit
 h the lulav and etrog SEVEN times and beat the willow branches.  This day m
 arks the ultimate conclusion of the penitential season.  Its ceremonies are
  deeply linked to nature.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063753Z
LOCATION:Beth Ami Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Morning Minyan (Hoshana Rabba)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
