DESCRIPTION:We are inviting every child and parent at the religious school\
 , students at the Sunday morning adult classes\, members of the synagogue\,
  and interested members of the public once a month for breakfast. We will h
 ave bagels\, shmears\, and juices at the library. We will have a chance to 
 talk about our new books\, news in the world of Jewish books\, or any other
