UID:qamtctuga2hk268ppeaf3hj7lo@google.com
CREATED:20090701T183359Z
DESCRIPTION:Rosh Chodesh Elul … August 20\, 2009 \nRenewal and celebration.
  It’s all about “me!” Claim your space in time as a Jewish woman and come t
 o Beth Ami’s Social Hall on Thursday\, August 20 at 7pm. Why? Here are a fe
 w comments from Rosh Chodesh women to pique your curiosity.\nAttending Rosh
  Chodesh gatherings has helped me take note of each new month\; celebrating
  the new moon with Jewish friends has been very meaningful for me. \nBeing 
 a part of Rosh Chodesh has given me the knowledge of the holiday\, new frie
 nds\, and the sense of belonging to the Jewish community.\nI’ve become much
  more sensitive to the movement of the seasons\, how they effect my own spi
 rituality\, and to my need for the companionship of other Jewish women.\nJo
 in us!\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063723Z
LOCATION:Social Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Rosh Chodesh Group
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
