CREATED:20240618T235900Z
DESCRIPTION:<blockquote><strong>Join us for a wine\, cheese and dessert One
 g<br>Presentation will follow. Please RSVP.</strong><br><br>Learn about the
  lives of immigrant workers in our community and their current efforts to h
 ave successful jobs so they can build a more just future. Learn about the p
 arallels of their struggles and the hardships shared by our Jewish immigran
 t parents\, grandparents and ancestors. For over 20 years\, Max Bell Alper 
 has organized economic\, racial\, and climate justice throughout California
 . He has helped build North Bay Jobs with Justice into a grassroots coaliti
 on of over 30 community and labor organizations.<br><br><br></blockquote>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240717T184305Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Oneg with guest speaker Max Alper from the North Bay Jobs with Just
 ice
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
