DESCRIPTION:Rosh Chodesh Nisan\n\nMonday\, March 15 at 7 pm\n\nAll Jewish w
 omen are invited to celebrate the month of Nisan on Monday\, March 15 at 7 
 pm. We’ll celebrate with bells\, whistles\, drums\, and flutes … and perfor
 m the ritual of Kos Miriam (The Cup of Miriam) together. Bring musical inst
 ruments (i.e.\, bells\, drums\, flutes\, whistles\, tambourines\, sticks\, 
 scrapers\, rattles\, kitchen pots … and a snack to share. (Hint: The first 
 seder is just two weeks after Rosh Chodesh. Here’s a chance to “share” your
  chametz treats!\n\nQuestions: contact Patty Bernstein at basberyl@sonic.ne
 t or 546-6043.\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230220T063643Z
LOCATION:Congregation Beth Ami
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Rosh Chodesh
TRANSP:OPAQUE
