DESCRIPTION:Jewish Ethics and Contemporary Issues \nRabbi Jerry M. Danzig\n
 How Jewish ethics evolved from the Torah\, \nthrough the Talmud\, classical
  and current \nresponsa to guide us in responding to existential current mo
 ral and medical issues: e.g. The Self: Hobbes vs. God\; Our Right To Dignit
 y at \nthe End Of Life\; Self-preservation\; Homosexuality\; Self and Other
 s\, e.g. Law of Rebuke\; \nPopulation Control\; Capital Punishment\; Good \
 nCitizenship\; Civil Disobedience\; etc. 
