DESCRIPTION:The Advocates for Social Justice Committee at CBA is sponsoring
  an activity on Martin Luther King Day. It is being organized by Community 
 Baptist Church\, Community Equity Foundation and City<br>of Santa Rosa Park
 s &amp\; Rec.<br><br>Come join in the clean-up at Martin Luther King Jr. Pa
 rk (1208 Hendley St.). We can help beautify this neighborhood park through 
 tasks such<br>as picking up litter\, spreading mulch\, weeding and more. To
 ols and light refreshments will be provided. Please register. Space is limi
 ted. To register go to the website: <a href="https://srcity.volunteerhub.co
 m">https://srcity.volunteerhub.com</a> or call<br>Santa Rosa Parks and Recr
 eation Volunteer Program Desk at 707-543-3279.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250106T201133Z
