DESCRIPTION:<p><strong>Are you interesting in seeing how our Kosher kitchen
  is run and how it works? Perhaps add to our ranks of Mashgichim\, (Kitchen
  Mavens) Then we have a class for you.</strong><br><br><strong>We're offeri
 ng an Introduction to the Beth Ami Kitchen on Sunday December 15th</strong>
 </p><p><strong>at 10:30 AM.</strong><br>We will offer some informal discuss
 ions starting with why CBA has a Kosher kitchen\; and also covering kitchen
  safety\, food safety\, the roles of the event coordinators\, chefs\, Mashg
 ichim\, and volunteers in the kitchen.<br>The deadline to sign up for this 
 class is Wednesday\, December 4th . We will then email out various document
 s for you to review before class\, covering some of the issues we deal with
  when working in the kitchen.<br><br>If you are interested\, you can reach 
 out to Myra Stern-Thomas at (707) 287-0786‬ or call the office at (707) 360
 -3000. We will need your name\, your email address and a phone number where
  we can reach you if there is a problem. Thank you\,<br>~janet</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20241209T194049Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Mashgiach Class
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
