CREATED:20230228T003019Z
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Yes\, in spite of all the Purim craziness\, there is a 
 Friday night Shabbat dinner at CBA March 3</strong>. Join us for Kabbalat s
 ervices at 6 pm live and on Zoom followed by music from<strong> Klezmer Cre
 ek </strong>and a scrumptious milchik or pareve dinner prepared by David Ka
 hn. Please make your reservation by the preceding Wednesday at 5 pm. Adults
  $18 \, children 5 – 13 $9\, children under 5 free. Some scholarships avail
 able. Call 707-360-3000 or email <a href="mailto:office@bethamisr.org">offi
 ce@bethamisr.org</a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230228T003255Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Shabbat Dinner 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
