DESCRIPTION:<p>This year before we start the fast (which begins at 8:08 p.m
 . on Monday and ends at 8:41p.m. on Tuesday)\, we’re having a PREFAST meal 
 starting at 6:30 p.m. at CBA followed by the Tisha B’Av service beginning a
 t 8:00 p.m. <br><br>Please bring a cold vegetarian or kosher dairy dish to 
 share as we gather together to provide prayers and comfort especially in th
 is time of turmoil.  There will be a Zoom option for services. </p><p>Pleas
 e see the <a href="https://bethamisr.shulcloud.com/track.php?id=581787a5357
 247bb9f664535094a03c1&color=b3b3b5&url=https%3A%2F%2Fbethamisr.org%2Fwp-con
 tent%2Fuploads%2F2013%2F03%2FFood-and-Potluck-Guidelines.pdf&h=7f6a0" targe
 t="_blank"><u>CBA potluck guidelines</u></a> for ideas and more info<br></p
 >
LAST-MODIFIED:20240807T182059Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pre-Fast Potluck 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
