UID:dfnglm6dvj3ur39q8ksr8uaivc@google.com
CREATED:20111011T210359Z
DESCRIPTION:Section 2 - for students of all ages. Many Jews have not had th
 e opporunity to study Judaism as adults and gain a mature understanding of 
 what is one of the most sphisticated relisious systems in the world. We wil
 l explore the values and spritual meaning behind various defining elements 
 of Jewish religious experience\, including prayer\, Shabbat\, holidays\, ka
 shrut\, ethics\, and Torah study. We will also learn contemporary expresion
 s of faith in God and analyze attempts to answer the question\; who wrote t
 he Bible? You might be surprised!
LAST-MODIFIED:20240918T041535Z
LOCATION:Congregation Beth Ami
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Adult Ed. #102 - Why Be Jewish? Section 2
