BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Congregation Beth Ami
DTSTART:20260113T013000Z
DTEND:20260113T023000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:7jsk6acc0ehq9e9ape5ss8v4is@google.com
CREATED:20260107T181643Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The <em>Siddur Master Class</em> at Congregation Beth Ami in
 vites participants into a deeper exploration of <strong>Siddur Hadash</stro
 ng>\, the prayer book that shapes our communal worship and spiritual life. 
 This course offers an opportunity to slow down\, look closely\, and redisco
 ver the meaning\, theology\, and poetry embedded in the prayers we recite t
 ogether.</p><p>Through guided study and discussion\, we will explore the <s
 trong>structure\, themes\, and values of Siddur Hadash</strong>\, examining
  how traditional liturgy and contemporary Conservative perspectives come to
 gether to express Jewish spirituality\, ethics\, and hope. Attention will b
 e given to the historical roots of the prayers\, their evolving interpretat
 ions\, and how they speak to modern lives and concerns.</p><p>This class go
 es beyond learning <em>what</em> comes next in the service. Instead\, it fo
 cuses on <strong>why these prayers matter</strong>\, <strong>how their lang
 uage shapes Jewish identity</strong>\, and <strong>how Siddur Hadash reflec
 ts Conservative Judaism’s commitment to inclusivity\, meaning\, and persona
 l connection</strong>.</p><p><strong>Participants will:</strong></p><ul><li
 ><p>Gain confidence navigating Shabbat and festival services at Beth Ami</p
 ></li><li><p>Explore key prayers and themes unique to <em>Siddur Hadash</em
 ></p></li><li><p>Discover how tradition and innovation interact in Conserva
 tive liturgy</p></li><li><p>Deepen personal intention (<em>kavanah</em>) an
 d spiritual engagement</p></li><li><p>Find new entry points into communal a
 nd individual prayer</p></li></ul><p>Whether you are a longtime member or n
 ew to Beth Ami\, this master class offers a welcoming space to ask question
 s\, share insights\, and transform the siddur from a familiar book into a s
 ource of inspiration and connection.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260107T181643Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Siddur Master Class: Exploring Siddur Hadash
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
