DTEND:20260421T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:0ijkdntupj0h0msqvh7ea5qjhq@google.com
CREATED:20260310T172946Z
DESCRIPTION:Put on your dancing Shoes.   Israeli Dancing is back at CBA!   
  \n\nOn Monday\, March 30th at 7 pm\, please join Robin Lowitz and others i
 n the wonderful art of Israeli dancing.    \n\n We'll continue with Monday 
 sessions on April 6th and 20th.  See the Beth Ami online calendar for futur
 e dates. Cost is free for Beth Ami members\; for non-members a suggested do
 nation of $8 covers Beth Ami cost. Sliding scale available.\n     \n Please
  preregister by email at office@bethamisr.org by leaving your name\, phone 
 number with event name. Or call 707-360-3000 and leave a message. For more 
 information contact Robin directly at robinlowitz@yahoo.com.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260310T172946Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Israeli Dancing
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
