CREATED:20251027T213808Z
DESCRIPTION:What’s really going on in Israel ?\nHear local folks talk about
  their recent trips.\n\nRegister with Beth Ami\n(707) 360-3000 / office@bet
 hamisr.org\n\nBetty Boyd and Eli Cohen joined the Mossad Mission to Israel\
 nThe mission explored Israel’s intelligence and defense forces\, offering c
 ritical insights into the challenges the country faces.\n\nNancy and Andy F
 leming joined the Times of Israel Tour\nAn 8-day in-depth\, on-the-ground e
 xperience of Tel Aviv\, Galilee\, Jerusalem & the Gaza Envelope with Times 
 of Israel journalists.\n\nCo-sponsored by CST Friends of Israel and Beth Am
 i Israel committee
LAST-MODIFIED:20251126T221901Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY: "Visiting Israel in a Time of War" 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
