UID:7pnu4ptug7pavnjqev0un122mc@google.com
CREATED:20260313T203434Z
DESCRIPTION:We are all signed up for the Sonoma County 2026 Pride Parade wh
 ich takes place from 11:00 am to noon on Saturday\, June 6\, in downtown Sa
 nta Rosa. Pride and True is the theme.   \n\nIf you have a Pride t-shirt wi
 th the rainbow Beth Ami logo\, or rainbow colored clothes\, come dressed an
 d ready to walk the 5 block parade route down 4th Street from Brookwood. \n
 \nWe’ll gather in Fremont Cancer Survivors’ Park at 9:45 a.m for a quick Sh
 abbat morning service led by Rabbi Koas then line up for the walk close to 
 Brookwood and 4th. \nThere will also be services in the Beth Ami Sanctuary 
 led by congregants. We hope we can all get together for lunch in the social
  hall afterwards. \n\nBring sunscreen\, walking shoes and water. Contact th
 e office at office@bethamisr.org to tell us you’re coming\; put Pride Parad
 e in the subject line.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260521T221602Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sonoma County Pride Parade
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
