 e will be<b>Celebrating Shabbat\, </b>our most cherished Jewish weekly ritu
 al. <b><br><br></b></p><p>Y <b> Shabbat Songs</b></p><p>Y <b> Shabbat Story
 telling</b></p><p>Y <b> Shabbat Blessings with Rabbi Koas</b></p><p>Y <b> M
 aking Challah Covers</b></p><p><br><br>For more info: <a href="mailto:offic
 e@bethamisr.org">office@bethamisr.org</a>  707-360-3000<br></p>
