 ercome crisis.\n\nWe meet for discussion Sunday\, May 31\, in a member’s ho
 me. There are several loaner copies available that I borrowed from the SF J
 ewish Community Library. Everyone who reads the book is welcome to join us.
 \n\nFor comments and details phone Linda 707-544-4532 (landline.)
