BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Congregation Beth Ami
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20251220T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20251220T113000
DTSTAMP:20260803T040530Z
UID:3789g070iadpcv8bkundvjejtm@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20251220T110000
CREATED:20251021T180734Z
DESCRIPTION:Introducing Tot Shabbat!\n\nWe are excited to invite you and yo
 ur little ones to a brand-new\, kid-friendly Shabbat experience led by Zoe.
  Join us once a month for Tot Shabbat\, a warm and playful hour designed ju
 st for children ages 1 to 5. We will have stories\, songs\, and activities 
 that help introduce our youngest members to the beauty of Shabbat and Jewis
 h traditions in a way that is fun and engaging. Beginning November 15th fro
 m 11 till noon. Bring your kids\, let them sing along\, and watch them disc
 over the joy of Shabbat in a welcoming and lively atmosphere. We can't wait
  to celebrate together!
LAST-MODIFIED:20251124T184452Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tot Shabbat led by Lauren Kalmanson
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
