UID:1mpb85dmk0g59i4grrcns61koc@google.com
CREATED:20260310T172824Z
DESCRIPTION:Put on your dancing Shoes.   Israeli Dancing is back at CBA!   
  <br><br>On Monday\, March 30th at 7 pm\, please join Robin Lowitz and othe
 rs in the wonderful art of Israeli dancing.    <br><br> We'll continue with
  Monday sessions on April 6th and 20th.  See the Beth Ami online calendar f
 or future dates. Cost is free for Beth Ami members\; for non-members a sugg
 ested donation of $8 covers Beth Ami cost. Sliding scale available.<br>    
  <br> Please preregister by email at <a href="mailto:office@bethamisr.org" 
 target="_blank"><u>office@bethamisr.org</u></a> by leaving your name\, phon
 e number with event name. Or call 707-360-3000 and leave a message. For mor
 e information contact Robin directly at <a href="mailto:robinlowitz@yahoo.c
 om" target="_blank"><u>robinlowitz@yahoo.com</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260310T172959Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Israeli Dancing
TRANSP:OPAQUE
