 e not alone. Join us for a supportive and compassionate gathering where par
 ticipants can share their experiences\, find comfort\, and receive encourag
 ement from others who understand the journey of grief.</p><p>Whether your l
 oss is recent or many years ago\, all are welcome.</p><p><b>Facilitator:</b
 > Neil Herring</p><p>For more information or to RSVP\, please contact Rabbi
  Koas.</p>
