 e scholarships available. Call 707-360-3000 or email <a href="mailto:office
 @bethamisr.org" target="_blank">office@bethamisr.org</a>.</b></p><p><b>A po
 rtion of net proceeds from the BBQ will go directly to VIDAS.</b></p><p><b>
